# src/apps/daemon/internal/analysis/provider

## Purpose
Immutable provider corpus, lookup, manifest, and activation primitives used by scanner/API provider workflows.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `analysis` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (6): `builtin.go`, `circumvention_catalog.go`, `circumvention_catalog_test.go`, `corpus.go`, `corpus_test.go`, `manifest.go`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `provider`.
- Notable exported surface: `BuildSnapshot`, `BuiltinCorpus`, `CircumventionCapability`, `CircumventionCatalog`, `Corpus`, `DefaultService`, `Manifest`, `Match`, `Parse`, `Service` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `cmd`, `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/analysis/netintel`.

## Invariants
- `analysis` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

